{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 1000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yomojomo of Didi and Jeong Tae-woong's Life in Korea"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hello, this is Didi."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 11000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hello, this is Jeong Tae-woong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 13000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yomojomo of Life in Korea is a podcast where two people living in Korea talk about the various aspects of life in Korea."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20000,
    "dDurationMs": 9000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How many episodes is this now? Is it the fifth one? We've been doing this for almost a month—how are you finding it? Is it going well, Teacher Tae-woong?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 30000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm really enjoying it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 31000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's good? I'm relieved."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 33000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I really like that I just have to talk and that's it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm taking care of all the editing and uploading it myself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 42000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 43000,
    "dDurationMs": 11000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And when we uploaded the first episode, there was a really nice comment, so I'd like to read that first and then talk about today's topic."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 55000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But they left it in English, so I translated it into Korean and I'll read it for you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 67000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm really looking forward to this podcast collaboration."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 69000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They said that Didi and Teacher Tae-woong are really a great complement to each other, like you complement each other."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 76000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Didi's content is really systematic and clean, so it's comfortable to watch and listen to, and it's very helpful for studying."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 83000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And Teacher Tae-woong's content is fun to watch thanks to his charm and friendly personality."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 90000,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Didi tends to talk more about Korean culture in general, while Teacher Tae-woong seems to share a lot of personal life experiences."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 98000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And both of you are great at adjusting the language difficulty, but it doesn't feel unnatural at all, which is really nice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 105000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's what they wrote."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 107000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's a really nice comment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 110000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was happy because they really picked out the strengths well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 116000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's very rewarding."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 118000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right. I was a bit worried about this, wondering if many people would listen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 122000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Still, it seems like many people are listening for listening practice, so that's good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 129000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you so much."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 131000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It makes it worth doing. Thank you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 133000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Complement."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 135000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Complement. They said \"each other.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 139000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In economic terms, we call it a complementary good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 143000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Things that complement each other. For example, there's pork belly and lettuce."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 149000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And chicken and beer, you could say."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 152000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's a perfect analogy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 156000,
    "dDurationMs": 9000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The characteristic of complementary goods is that when the price of one goes up, the price of the complementary good also goes up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 165000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Isn't that something you covered in episode one of your All Things Korean podcast?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 170000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right. It's something I covered a long time ago."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 172000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right. Right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 173000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Was it episode two or three? Anyway, it was a long time ago, before the interview."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 177000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you were doing it alone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 179000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I remember. Shark complementary goods."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 184000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I'll keep talking while complementing each other like this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 189000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So let me explain today's topic. What was today's topic?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 195000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Today's topic is cleaning."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 198000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Cleaning. I think everyone probably knows what cleaning is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 202000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's like tidying up dirty things and making them clean."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 207000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It seems like there are many different types of cleaning."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 212000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 213000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's house cleaning, bathroom cleaning, and various other types."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 218000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you clean often, Teacher Tae-woong?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 221000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't clean very often."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 225000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How much is that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 229000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think it depends on how far you define cleaning."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 236000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Actually, there's cleaning and organizing, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 241000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right. Organizing, tidying up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 246000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is organizing more like a simpler kind of cleaning?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 252000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right. Like putting things that are scattered around back in their place?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 257000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right. Putting things in order."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 261000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Putting things in their proper place."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 264000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In that sense, I always organize."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 271000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right. I saw you post pictures of your desk on Instagram and it looked really neat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 277000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. I always organize."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 280000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I can't stand seeing things not organized."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 283000,
    "dDurationMs": 9000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Really? So you do things like organize your desk, bed, bedding, stuff like that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 292000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Always."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 293000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Organize your clothes?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 294000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Always."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 296000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wait. It seems like I don't organize my closet very well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 299000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you say organize the closet, is that what you mean?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 301000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You organize it every time the season changes?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 305000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. I classify all the clothes one by one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 309000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Put t-shirts in one drawer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 312000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Put thin pants in another drawer. Like that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 316000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't do that very often."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 319000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You don't?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 321000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's just the closet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 323000,
    "dDurationMs": 10000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I always organize other places like my desk, bed, and bookshelf."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 333000,
    "dDurationMs": 9000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But usually when people clean, they run a vacuum cleaner."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 342000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Or they wipe the floor with a mop."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 345000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's what comes to mind, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 347000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right. Right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 348000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But that kind of cleaning, well, I think I do it about once every two weeks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 355000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But Tae-woong, you're living with your family right now, aren't you?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 359000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 362000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How is it? Do you clean by yourself?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 367000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I only clean my own space."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 370000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 371000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. Separately."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 373000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But what about your living room and kitchen? You use those, don't you?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 381000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I do use them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 386000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I use them, but most of the things there aren't things I use."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 392000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You use them less frequently?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 394000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 395000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't really know how I should organize them either."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 401000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The main user should organize them?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 403000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 406000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If I organize them on my own without knowing well"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 411000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "wouldn't it be confusing for other people when they use it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 416000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that's why you don't do it, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 418000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So when you clean about once every two weeks, you run the vacuum"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 422000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and what, a mop? Do you call it a mop? Do you mop with something like that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 428000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't use a mop these days."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 432000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These days I just run the vacuum on the floor"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 438000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and run the vacuum on the desk"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 443000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and run the vacuum on the floor"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 447000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and wipe things like the desk."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 452000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But these days I just wipe with wet wipes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 457000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But overall it seems really clean."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 461000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It does seem that way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 462000,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I organize every day and clean about two or three times a month."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 472000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's the opposite of me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 474000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was going to ask how it is for you, Didi."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 477000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It seems like the opposite of me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 479000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think there are almost no days when my place is well organized."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 483000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is that so?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 484000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. I'm a messy person."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 490000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think I developed bad habits from when I was young."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 493000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the thing is, getting messy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 498000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is really easy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 502000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 503000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But organizing takes a lot of time?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 508000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's organizing things one by one..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 513000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So when one thing gets messy, if you organize it right away,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 517000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it doesn't take long, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 520000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But when several things get messy,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 524000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "organizing takes a bit longer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 528000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's a tip."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 529000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Things you actually use, you just put them back in their spot right away,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 536000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or is there a rule?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 538000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Actually, that's basically it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 539000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's all there is to it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 540000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Why can't I do that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 542000,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First, you need to clearly decide on the original spot, the proper place"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 551000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where each item should be."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 555000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If that's clear, even if something's somewhere else,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 558000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you quickly know where it should go, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 563000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That sounds like the first step for me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 566000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So then every single item has its own spot?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 570000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 571000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Really, even just one tissue? Even just one wet wipe?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 574000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. Otherwise,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 576000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there's one tip, and it's like"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 578000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "kind of a trash bin that's not a trash bin,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 584000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like one drawer compartment,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 586000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so for things where you don't know where to put them,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 592000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you create a space to gather all that miscellaneous stuff."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 600000,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You put things that originally have a spot in their original spot as much as possible,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 605600,
    "dDurationMs": 9040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but if it's like, I don't know where this goes, then you just shove it into that miscellaneous space."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 614640,
    "dDurationMs": 1999,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Kind of like a storage room feeling?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 616639,
    "dDurationMs": 1441,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, that's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 618080,
    "dDurationMs": 8080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then I'm curious about this too—do you have a lot of things?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 626240,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think that's relative?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 630240,
    "dDurationMs": 7679,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What do you see on the desk you're sitting at right now?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 637919,
    "dDurationMs": 6401,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First, a monitor, and two books,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 644320,
    "dDurationMs": 8200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and a phone stand that I use for interviews or YouTube filming,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 652520,
    "dDurationMs": 11920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and a keyboard, and a schedule board where I record and edit my schedule and things like that,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 664440,
    "dDurationMs": 9399,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and a candle, one candle, and what you call a notepad. That legal pad."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 673839,
    "dDurationMs": 8241,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Two of these, and one tumbler, one water cup,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 682080,
    "dDurationMs": 5759,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and oh! I use a large speaker separately."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 687839,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 688919,
    "dDurationMs": 12561,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But for that speaker, I use two small drawers about the size of two palms,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 701519,
    "dDurationMs": 5841,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I put one drawer in each speaker's spot and put the speaker on top of it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 707360,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I use that drawer space pretty well too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 710160,
    "dDurationMs": 3119,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, does it have pens and stuff in it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 713279,
    "dDurationMs": 7161,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes yes yes, and cables and things like that, USB drives and such."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 720440,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I keep them hidden."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 722080,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, it's neat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 726760,
    "dDurationMs": 2159,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I have all sorts of things piled up on mine right now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 728919,
    "dDurationMs": 1041,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What kind of things are piled up?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 729960,
    "dDurationMs": 8360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, similar stuff—computer supplies and all, and there are a few things here I don't even know why they're here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 738320,
    "dDurationMs": 719,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What are they?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 739039,
    "dDurationMs": 7240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, a clothing belt, how do I say it? Like a jacket belt."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 746279,
    "dDurationMs": 5441,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This doesn't have separate storage."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 751720,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's not like it's attached to the jacket, so I should have stored it separately and hung it up, but I was lazy and left it here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 756520,
    "dDurationMs": 5640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So there's clothing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 762160,
    "dDurationMs": 1239,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's clothing, and then a lint roller."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 763399,
    "dDurationMs": 3561,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A lint roller?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 766960,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This one hasn't found its spot yet either."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 768080,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know what this is?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 770240,
    "dDurationMs": 1039,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a tool for removing dust, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 771279,
    "dDurationMs": 2681,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, I have this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 773960,
    "dDurationMs": 2799,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네, 이거 있고."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 776759,
    "dDurationMs": 4321,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I had filmed a cosmetics podcast before."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 781080,
    "dDurationMs": 5880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So cosmetics, cosmetics that didn't go back to their place."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 786960,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Things like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 789320,
    "dDurationMs": 3799,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you have a separate space where you keep only cosmetics, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 793119,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, I do."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 795919,
    "dDurationMs": 3041,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They didn't go back, here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 798960,
    "dDurationMs": 920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To organize them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 799880,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Instead, I run the vacuum cleaner every day."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 802960,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Every day?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 804080,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm kind of the opposite, so organizing is fine, but I hate dirty things."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 808960,
    "dDurationMs": 640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 809600,
    "dDurationMs": 6239,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dust piling up and the bathroom not being cleaned and things like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 815839,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Things that seem unhygienic and dirty."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 818919,
    "dDurationMs": 3321,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, you're really the complete opposite."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 822240,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Completely opposite."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 825600,
    "dDurationMs": 8280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And when I clean, I want to share my family home's cleaning method with other people a bit"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 833880,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I want to share and see if other people do it this way too"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 837440,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At our family home, we do a deep clean once a week."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 842240,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Completely vacuum and wipe with a mop"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 846600,
    "dDurationMs": 5599,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And wipe all the dust and things on top of that with a cloth and hand cloth"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 852199,
    "dDurationMs": 4801,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Doing this kind of thing once a week"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 857000,
    "dDurationMs": 4279,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it seems like the vacuum cleaner keeps running"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 861279,
    "dDurationMs": 4441,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I'm curious if everyone does cleaning to this extent when they talk about cleaning."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 865720,
    "dDurationMs": 6600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Vacuuming, wet mopping, bathroom cleaning, and all that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 872320,
    "dDurationMs": 4919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First of all, that's a very excellent parenting method."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 877239,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's very good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 878679,
    "dDurationMs": 3641,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The house is clean."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 882320,
    "dDurationMs": 9079,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Our house seems to just do a quick clean of the floor."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 891399,
    "dDurationMs": 6481,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We run the vacuum and sometimes wipe the floor when we do that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 897880,
    "dDurationMs": 1959,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you use a cordless vacuum?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 899839,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 902279,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I bought a cordless vacuum. I was frustrated."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 906799,
    "dDurationMs": 5241,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But is that okay? Doesn't it lack power?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 912040,
    "dDurationMs": 1359,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They're coming out well these days."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 913399,
    "dDurationMs": 3521,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They're coming out well? Which brand do you use?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 916920,
    "dDurationMs": 2439,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's not a major company product"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 919359,
    "dDurationMs": 1040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 920399,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like some Kakao Makers?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 922359,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Huh? So that's what it was."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 924239,
    "dDurationMs": 6681,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. I use something made by a place like that, and it's better than I thought."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 930920,
    "dDurationMs": 3879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Really? Does one battery charge clean everything?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 934799,
    "dDurationMs": 841,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It seems like it does."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 935640,
    "dDurationMs": 3199,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh that's good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 938839,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Have you tried that? A robot vacuum?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 941399,
    "dDurationMs": 3201,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I haven't tried that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 944600,
    "dDurationMs": 4799,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That was really a trend at one point. When it first came out and all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 949399,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My mom also bought one back then and ran it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 953959,
    "dDurationMs": 4681,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But that one can't run every day. When I tried it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 958640,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh why?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 960000,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It doesn't get into the corners"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 964200,
    "dDurationMs": 3879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So even though we do cleaning once a week"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 968079,
    "dDurationMs": 5361,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Still, every day dust and things move around and it can suck them up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 973440,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I just used it that way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 977880,
    "dDurationMs": 6440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That one is kind of dumb, though it might be different these days."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 984320,
    "dDurationMs": 4519,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like it goes and then gets lost or what is it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 988839,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The floor has to be completely clear."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 990959,
    "dDurationMs": 801,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 991760,
    "dDurationMs": 3799,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Things like chairs have to be put away too"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 995559,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I was disappointed with the robot vacuum."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1000079,
    "dDurationMs": 1801,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1001880,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So to use a robot vacuum,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1005040,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I have to create an environment where the robot vacuum can work, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1008720,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I have to create it. I have to organize everything anyway."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1011320,
    "dDurationMs": 2199,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1013519,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I'm actually assisting the robot vacuum."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1016959,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right. Whether it's reducing work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1021399,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah, I see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1024679,
    "dDurationMs": 720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The robot vacuum."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1025399,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh but I'm planning to move out this year"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1033720,
    "dDurationMs": 4920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and live alone when I do,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1038640,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and there's a house I want to move to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1043160,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but that house hasn't come on the market yet as a vacant unit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1045720,
    "dDurationMs": 1839,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, there's a house you're looking at?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1047559,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, there is, and if that house becomes available,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1052959,
    "dDurationMs": 1801,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I end up moving,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1054760,
    "dDurationMs": 4919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm thinking of getting a robot vacuum."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1059679,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But actually, I think I might buy one too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1061679,
    "dDurationMs": 961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1062839,
    "dDurationMs": 1761,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But is the house big?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1064600,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's not small for living alone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1067880,
    "dDurationMs": 2519,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Does it have rooms? It's not a studio?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1070399,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's not a studio."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1071399,
    "dDurationMs": 2481,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh then I think that would be nice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1073880,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1075920,
    "dDurationMs": 5720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I'm an extreme minimalist,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1081640,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You're a minimalist?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1083640,
    "dDurationMs": 919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It seems like it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1084559,
    "dDurationMs": 2441,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you don't have many possessions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1087000,
    "dDurationMs": 1799,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1088839,
    "dDurationMs": 4361,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So when I imagine the house I'll live in later,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1093200,
    "dDurationMs": 3359,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there won't be much in the house,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1096559,
    "dDurationMs": 4761,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it would be a really nice environment for a robot vacuum to run around in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1101320,
    "dDurationMs": 2959,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1104279,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if it's that kind of house, wouldn't a robot vacuum be okay?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1107839,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's the kind of thought I had."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1110239,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you buy a robot vacuum, you won't clean?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1115039,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wouldn't you have to anyway?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1118239,
    "dDurationMs": 1841,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You need two."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1120080,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You need to buy a robot vacuum and also have a cordless one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1123760,
    "dDurationMs": 2719,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that's why"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1126479,
    "dDurationMs": 2281,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there's a saying called \"gyeryuk.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1128760,
    "dDurationMs": 1959,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Gyeryuk, what does that mean?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1130719,
    "dDurationMs": 840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Gyeryuk."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1131559,
    "dDurationMs": 721,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A chicken's"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1132280,
    "dDurationMs": 2959,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a chicken's rib meat"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1135239,
    "dDurationMs": 4401,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so there's not much quantity to eat,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1139640,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it's a waste not to eat it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1142840,
    "dDurationMs": 2199,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's awkward to have it and awkward not to have it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1145039,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it's still convenient to have it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1146799,
    "dDurationMs": 2481,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Exactly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1149280,
    "dDurationMs": 4439,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think it would be good to buy one if you can."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1153719,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You have plans to move out on your own."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1155799,
    "dDurationMs": 1281,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Move out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1157080,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh yes, I need to do it that way"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1161400,
    "dDurationMs": 4399,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so the pace of offline interviews"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1165799,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can happen in the environment I want,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1168679,
    "dDurationMs": 1281,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that would be really nice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1169960,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1172679,
    "dDurationMs": 2601,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I hope a house comes up soon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1175280,
    "dDurationMs": 920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1176200,
    "dDurationMs": 3519,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you don't do things like cleaning the bathroom?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1179719,
    "dDurationMs": 880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1180599,
    "dDurationMs": 1041,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1181640,
    "dDurationMs": 1279,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1182919,
    "dDurationMs": 1041,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1183960,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But when I was living alone,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1186760,
    "dDurationMs": 1599,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I did it often."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1188359,
    "dDurationMs": 1841,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How often did you do it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1190200,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Twice a week?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1191400,
    "dDurationMs": 1159,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wow."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1192559,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's really clean."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1194559,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1196039,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You seem to be quite tidy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1198239,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah, I guess so."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1199239,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But why do you clean it so often?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1201000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The bathroom got dirty very easily."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1206000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm not sure why,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1209000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A bathroom like that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1211000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. For some reason, dirt accumulated easily on the floor,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1214000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I think it was a bathroom that didn't have good ventilation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1218000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, I think so."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1220000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And usually you shower in the bathroom, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1227000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1228000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But back then, after I finished showering, I would also dry my hair inside the bathroom,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1234000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and because of that, a lot of hair fell out,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1238000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so it got messy very easily."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1241000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah, how is it now?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1244000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you blow-dry your hair in the bathroom now, or do you do it in your room?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1248000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now I do it in my room."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1251000,
    "dDurationMs": 9000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So now I tend to clean my room more often."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1260000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm, I see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1263000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In Korea, you live on wooden floors, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1268000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it seems like you vacuum and mop and things like that,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1274000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I'm from a country where you wear shoes and move around? Even in the room?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1278000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm curious how you clean."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1281000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1282000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1284000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You don't do it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1286000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just vacuum?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1288000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Vacuum? It seems like you'd probably just vacuum."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1292000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And like rugs and things like that,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1297000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "washing those is really annoying, isn't it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1300000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, it's tough."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1301000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you use a rug?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1303000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't use one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1304000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1305000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You won't put one in your future home either?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1308000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hmm... I think I will."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1311000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Honestly, I've never washed a rug before,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1315000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I just throw it away. After using it for like a year or two."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1320000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah, I see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1322000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because I don't buy really nice rugs in the first place."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1325000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. I'm planning to buy a big rug too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1331000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. One with a huge tiger drawn on it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1334000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1335000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1336000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You like that kind of aesthetic?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1337000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you look at the background behind Teacher Taeyong, there's something kind of Korean, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1343000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you like things like that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1344000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I do. A lot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1346000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1347000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1348000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "After I started the podcast, I became a bit interested in that sort of thing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1353000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, wanting to show a bit of identity?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1357000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Someone who talks about Korea, that kind of thing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1360000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm, that's nice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1362000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I also put things like that in the back with that kind of feeling."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1368000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right now what you can see in the back is a taekwondo black belt."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1372000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1373000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that gonryongpo? That's what kings wear, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1376000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1377000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that one—is that called dancheong?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1380000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right, yes, dancheong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1382000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you see traditional Korean houses, there are colorful patterns? You see things like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1386000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1387000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Where did you get it, the dancheong?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1390000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, that's actually a sports towel, you see?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1395000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Huh? Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1396000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A sports towel?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1397000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1398000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But they sell it in a design like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1402000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1403000,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I went backpacking for over about six months a while back"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1411000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I was trying to find a thin towel to minimize my luggage,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1416000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and while I was searching for sports towels, I found that one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1420000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1421000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I thought it would be nice to travel around with it, like, \"I'm Korean,\" you know?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1426000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I bought it with that kind of intention,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1429000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but—"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1430000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I've never actually used it for that purpose."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1434000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right, anyway it's a towel."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1437000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You've displayed it really nicely."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1439000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like a canvas or a frame."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1441000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh yeah? But that wasn't there originally."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1444000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right, it's new."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1446000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, I see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1448000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I got a keyboard recently"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1453000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1454000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, a piano, a piano."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1457000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, I'm using it to cover the keyboard."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1461000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Clever."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1462000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1463000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's pretty nice, isn't it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1464000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that gonryongpo?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1466000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that one—"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1467000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Royal item."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1468000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No, it's not actually a gonryongpo garment,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1471000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but last year, aside from last year, we have an animal every year, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1477000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1478000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This year is the year of the blue snake, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1480000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Snake, yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1481000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, last year—"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1482000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Blue."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1483000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Last year was the year of the blue dragon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1485000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right, yes, it was the blue dragon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1487000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I always have a site where I buy books,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1494000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's an online bookstore in Korea called Aladin."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1498000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1499000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that bookstore is famous for making and selling pretty merchandise."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1505000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, I didn't know that about Aladin."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1508000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. Aladdin really does make pretty merchandise well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1511000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1512000,
    "dDurationMs": 10000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But at the beginning of last year, since this year is the Year of the Blue Dragon,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1522000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they made merchandise related to the blue dragon,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1527000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you could buy it with mileage if you purchased books over 50,000 won."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1534000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But that one is a blanket."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1539000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a blanket with that golryongpo, that dragon pattern on it in blue."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1546000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I folded it nicely and hung it up over there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1549000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's pretty."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1550000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1551000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's pretty."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1552000,
    "dDurationMs": 9000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Actually, not many places sell items with that kind of feel, you know?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1561000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There aren't many."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1562000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. Since it's hard to find."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1565000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So whenever I see merchandise like that, I want to get it no matter what."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1572000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1574000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For those listening, if you want to buy pretty merchandise, it would be good to check Aladdin once."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1581000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Good. Aladdin has a lot of merchandise."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1587000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Teacher Tae-woong, could you introduce merchandise like that later?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1590000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are things like memo pads and stationery too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1596000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm curious about that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1598000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sounds good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1600000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The conversation went that way,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1602000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so what else is there when you clean?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1604000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Clean?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1605000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Have you done something like that before?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1607000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like move-in cleaning when you move."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1610000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What's that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1612000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you move, you go to a new place, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1616000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you can clean that place yourself if it's okay,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1622000,
    "dDurationMs": 9000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but things like air conditioners and washing machines—when you go to a place that's been used for a long time, they're really dirty, you know?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1631000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's a system that does sterilization and disinfection on places you can't see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1638000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I've never done it myself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1640000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1641000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1642000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "From what I hear, it sounds like it would be really good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1644000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It does seem convenient,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1646000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but then again, people's hearts are like this—"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1648000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it's not something I can't do myself, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1651000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is that so? Can you do things like air conditioner filter cleaning?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1655000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It just becomes \"let's just use it,\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1658000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the air conditioner—"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1663000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it does seem like something to think about."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1665000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It wasn't as expensive as you'd think."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1668000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How much was it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1670000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For a one-room, about 100,000 won?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1673000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's reasonable, isn't it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1675000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's literally just doing it once,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1678000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but detailed cleaning like air conditioners and washing machines would probably have additional charges."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1685000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sterilization and disinfection and removing old grime and things like that for 100,000 won?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1694000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I actually don't think sterilization and disinfection are necessary."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1702000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't think you need to go that far with sterilization,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1705000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but for things like air conditioners or washing machines,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1709000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "once you make them clean like new,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1712000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1713000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there's a difference in performance, isn't there?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1715000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1716000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it does sound tempting?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1718000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Depending on the condition of the place you're moving to,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1721000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if it's really not in good shape, it might be okay to use something like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1725000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That sounds like it would be really nice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1726000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Move-in cleaning."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1728000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Speaking of cleaning, it made me think of something."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1731000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Teacher Tae-woong, can you catch cockroaches?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1734000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I really hate them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1737000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Cockroaches are one of the things I dislike the most in this world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1742000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Me too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1743000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Have you seen them? At home?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1745000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I've seen them a lot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1746000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At home?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1747000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. Because my place is on the first floor."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1753000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1755000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't even want to talk about it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1758000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1759000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The cockroaches that live in regular people's homes are different from"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1766000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the cockroaches that live outside in nature."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1771000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They look quite different."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1775000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1777000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so the cockroaches in the house"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1780000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have a bit of a reddish tint."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1782000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh my god."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1783000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And they're not that big."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1786000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1788000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The house ones?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1790000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. The house ones."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1791000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They're relatively small."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1793000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They're relatively small."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1795000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Of course, when they grow up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1798000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1800000,
    "dDurationMs": 13000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they get bigger, but the problem is that the cockroaches living outside sometimes come into the house."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1813000,
    "dDurationMs": 10840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the cockroaches living outside are pitch black in color, and their size is basically about the size of a thumb."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1823840,
    "dDurationMs": 7920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Really? And in the worst case, why? They fly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1833000,
    "dDurationMs": 5480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that thing flies, like really."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1838919,
    "dDurationMs": 4601,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It makes this sound while doing that. What kind of sound?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1843520,
    "dDurationMs": 7680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It makes this sound while flying like a bee. Yes. It just flies like this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1851200,
    "dDurationMs": 6480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's really like a horror movie. It's really scary. It's really frightening."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1859240,
    "dDurationMs": 7480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, so you can definitely tell the difference then. Yes. And the way to deal with them would be different too, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1866720,
    "dDurationMs": 9080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The way to deal with them is actually the same. There's this thing, you know. Once a cockroach appears in your house, it means it's living there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1875800,
    "dDurationMs": 12320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like there are already about 100 living there. So you have to sign up for a service called Cesco that eliminates cockroaches and catches all the cockroaches in your house."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1888120,
    "dDurationMs": 6439,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. If it flew in from outside, you can just catch it and throw it away. Oh, that's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1896199,
    "dDurationMs": 8320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First floor isn't good for that. That's right. Do you really see them that often? Not that often."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1905519,
    "dDurationMs": 9201,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like four times a year? Four times seems like a lot? Three times?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1914720,
    "dDurationMs": 9640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Really? Yes. I don't think I could live like that. On the first floor. Exactly. I only had one come out. In my studio apartment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1924440,
    "dDurationMs": 14479,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh really? Yes. Did it have a reddish tint? Oh, I'm not sure. But it was a brand new place, you know. It was a brand new apartment in a completely new city."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1938919,
    "dDurationMs": 9920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think it probably came attached to the curtains I ordered. The delivery box. Apparently a lot come in that way. I think that's what happened."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1948839,
    "dDurationMs": 12000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But it was just one week after I started living on my own that a cockroach came in. I found it. It was stuck right on the curtain while I was hanging it up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1960839,
    "dDurationMs": 14920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that night I couldn't sleep. Oh, but I lost it. I lost sight of it. So I was trying to go to bed and suddenly I couldn't see it. It went out of my sight."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1975880,
    "dDurationMs": 14720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "After that I didn't see it, but about six months later I had laid tiles on my balcony. I was trying to throw away the tiles and when I lifted them, it was dead underneath."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1990600,
    "dDurationMs": 12480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, so it didn't spread. It doesn't seem to have spread. I sprayed some kind of pesticide that day and it died, but it went under the tiles and died. It hid there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2003080,
    "dDurationMs": 10440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, that's really fortunate. That's really fortunate. You really did a good job with early containment. Early containment. That's important."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2013520,
    "dDurationMs": 11000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I heard there's something really good for cockroaches. Something good for catching them. It was actually from real experience, but if you go to Olive Young in Korea, they sell something called Foot Shampoo."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2025360,
    "dDurationMs": 21520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Foot Shampoo. It's foot shampoo. It comes in blue color. You spray it like this. It's a revolutionary product where you can just spray it when you're too lazy to wash your feet and then rinse it off with the shower."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2046880,
    "dDurationMs": 16199,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Apparently it's really good at catching cockroaches. Oh really? If you spray it once, the cockroach gets paralyzed. Wow, that's amazing. So you always have to keep Foot Shampoo in the bathroom."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2063079,
    "dDurationMs": 17600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wow, I definitely need to have it stocked at home. You have to. It's good for washing your feet too, and if a cockroach comes out, apparently it breathes through its back or something, and the foam blocks all its breathing holes so it passes out. Oh, it passes out? Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2080679,
    "dDurationMs": 19321,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, I see. Wow. My friend caught one with that. Foot Shampoo, got it. This is definitely necessary. There's the green and blue bottle."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2100000,
    "dDurationMs": 20239,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But you know, there are these insect sprays. I have one principle about insect spray, or one thought about it. You absolutely have to keep two bottles of insect spray at home."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2120239,
    "dDurationMs": 19681,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Two? Why? You keep two bottles and use just one, and when one runs out, you have to use the new one. Then you have to buy another one at that time. Why? Because there's only one insect spray, one cockroach spray."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2139920,
    "dDurationMs": 14039,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If a cockroach comes out. But you have to spray it and kill it. But if that one runs out, what do you do? So you always have to keep a spare."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2153959,
    "dDurationMs": 11361,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, definitely. Because you have to catch it that urgently, in that moment. Exactly. You always have to be prepared."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2165519,
    "dDurationMs": 8121,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I see. Always keep it stocked. Get two bottles of Foot Shampoo too. Oh, I'm planning to. Two. Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2176959,
    "dDurationMs": 12840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh right. I actually have some really terrible experiences related to cockroaches. Yes. Experiences? Oh, well, experiences. Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2190799,
    "dDurationMs": 13121,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But should I tell this story or not? Is it interesting? Can I get a laugh out of you? It'll be shocking though. It's shocking? Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2203920,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But this seems like a story worth telling. Because it has a lot to do with cleaning. Please tell us. Please tell us."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2209239,
    "dDurationMs": 8681,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So when did this happen? It happened when I went to Bangladesh. In Bangladesh? Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2217920,
    "dDurationMs": 14680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was dispatched to Bangladesh and stayed in a hotel for about two months while going through a training period, and after the training ended, I found my own place and moved in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2233600,
    "dDurationMs": 12560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. So it was the evening of the first day I moved into that house. There wasn't much in the house back then. There was only a bed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2246160,
    "dDurationMs": 11639,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. So I had to talk with the landlord little by little and add furniture one piece at a time, but anyway, a cockroach came out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2257880,
    "dDurationMs": 6880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On the first day? Yes. A cockroach came out on the first day, but I thought that could happen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2264760,
    "dDurationMs": 10759,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I had already prepared for that and bought cockroach spray in advance. Yes. Two of them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2275519,
    "dDurationMs": 15081,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I bought it and sprayed the spray directly and caught it. I killed it. And I wrapped it up nicely with tissue and threw it in the toilet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2290600,
    "dDurationMs": 9840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. Anyway, that's what happened. That was in the evening. But also, the house I live in was pretty spacious."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2300440,
    "dDurationMs": 18679,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It had three rooms and two bathrooms, and since the rooms were spacious, I hung curtains in each room and secured the windows."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2319119,
    "dDurationMs": 7961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I came into the room where the bed I mainly use is and tried to sleep, so I was walking around the house."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2327080,
    "dDurationMs": 11039,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. But as I was going from one room to another room, there was a cockroach, so I sprayed the spray again and killed it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2338719,
    "dDurationMs": 16400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And after I did my business and moved to another room, I turned my back on the path I had come from and looked behind me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2355119,
    "dDurationMs": 9161,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But suddenly a cockroach that wasn't there before jumped out, got hit by the spray I had sprayed, flipped over, and was dying."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2365280,
    "dDurationMs": 15319,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you understand? Do you know what I mean? So think about it. As I was walking forward, there was a cockroach in front, so I sprayed it and passed by that cockroach."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2380599,
    "dDurationMs": 14361,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "After spraying? Yes. After spraying, I went forward and passed it. But I looked behind me. But suddenly a new cockroach came out and it was dead too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2394960,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Two of them? Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2396960,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah... yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2400000,
    "dDurationMs": 9000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But wow, this must have been absolutely crawling with them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2409000,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But that was the case in the kitchen too, and everywhere else, everywhere."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2414600,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So literally, you can't even imagine it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2417000,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Literally, if you turned around, there would be a cockroach right there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2421280,
    "dDurationMs": 11999,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I probably went through about 5 bottles of cockroach spray over 2 weeks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2433279,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I just sprayed it all over the house even when I didn't see any cockroaches."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2441279,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I went to a local mart and bought things like naphthalene balls."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2447279,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And placed them in all the corners."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2450279,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you know cockroaches hate toothpaste, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2456279,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Uh, I think I've heard about that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2458279,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, I bought about 10 of the cheapest toothpaste tubes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2463279,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wow, it was like a war."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2465279,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the kitchen and the window frames and all the windows, the window frames."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2473279,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The balcony, these large window frames, and every gap where things could come in from outside."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2480279,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What do you do?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2482279,
    "dDurationMs": 9000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I squeezed out the toothpaste and just smeared it all over, doing toothpaste everywhere."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2491279,
    "dDurationMs": 10000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Coating with toothpaste all the gaps and all the kitchen corners and places like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2501279,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it was really hard back then, and when I came home from work, I'd just keep doing that all day long."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2507279,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But couldn't you just move to a different place?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2511279,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I couldn't do that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2514279,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was really hopeless."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2516279,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that house was actually a nice place."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2520279,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So after 2 weeks of fighting that war."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2525279,
    "dDurationMs": 10000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "After that, not a single cockroach, ant, or even a fly or mosquito appeared."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2535279,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I'm curious, during those 2 weeks there were cockroach bodies everywhere, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2540279,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Of course."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2542279,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ugh, I really hate that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2545279,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Of course, of course."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2551279,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You must have gotten pretty tough after that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2554279,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I got a lot tougher, really wow, really."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2559279,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You probably wouldn't be startled by most cockroaches now?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2563279,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm not startled."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2565279,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's amazing, I really respect that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2567279,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No, but I still hate them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2569279,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I still hate them, still."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2571279,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Why do you hate cockroaches so much?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2573279,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2574279,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a bit interesting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2576279,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Why is it so disgusting?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2578279,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2581279,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Honestly, they're kind of similar to stag beetles, just black."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2585279,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I don't hate them that much."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2587279,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is it because the image is just so bad?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2590279,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In my opinion."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2592279,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The legs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2595279,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Those saw-like."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2597279,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You've looked at them closely, they have saw-like things?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2601279,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I just know the shape, the antennae."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2604279,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
